    <description>Surfaced by the version-mismatch triage of prospecting/community-version-reference.csv. Community's own geogebra package is stuck at 5.0.134 (published 2015-07-20, 4052 days stale) while the vendor is real at 6.0.927.1 — a major-version gap.</description>
    <tags>internal international-geogebra-institute</tags>
    <dependencies />
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
